#: ../../source/maintenance/git.rst:5
msgid "Git Configuration"
msgstr "Git 配置"

#: ../../source/maintenance/git.rst:8
msgid ""
"PartCAD imports packages from git repositories without the ``git`` command "
"line tool: it speaks the git protocols itself, through the ``libgit2`` "
"library that ships with its dependencies. Nothing has to be installed "
"alongside it for imports to work."
msgstr ""
"PartCAD 从 git 仓库导入包时并不需要 ``git`` 命令行工具：它通过随其依赖一起提供的 ``libgit2`` 库，自行实现了 git "
"协议。无需额外安装任何东西，导入功能即可正常工作。"

#: ../../source/maintenance/git.rst:12
msgid ""
"By default, PartCAD uses the system's Git configuration when importing "
"packages using git, which it reads from ``~/.gitconfig`` whether or not git "
"itself is installed. If you want to override these configurations, you can "
"add your overrides in ``~/.partcad/config.yaml`` as shown below:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，PartCAD 在使用 git 导入包时会使用系统的 Git 配置，无论 git 本身是否已安装，它都会从 ``~/.gitconfig``"
" 中读取该配置。如果你想覆盖这些配置，可以按如下所示在 ``~/.partcad/config.yaml`` 中添加你的覆盖项："

#: ../../source/maintenance/git.rst:26
msgid ""
"Cloning over SSH is faster and more reliable because it uses an efficient "
"protocol with lower overhead, supports compression, and maintains stable "
"connections via key-based authentication. SSH avoids HTTPS rate limits, "
"handles firewalls better, and eliminates credential prompts, making it ideal"
" for large repositories or frequent interactions."
msgstr ""
"通过 SSH 克隆更快也更可靠，因为它使用了一种开销更低的高效协议，支持压缩，并通过基于密钥的认证来保持稳定的连接。SSH 避免了 HTTPS "
"的速率限制，能更好地应对防火墙，并省去了凭据提示，这使它非常适合大型仓库或频繁的交互。"

#: ../../source/maintenance/git.rst:32
msgid ""
"Repositories reached over SSH are authenticated with the keys held by the "
"running SSH agent, and then with the default key files "
"(``~/.ssh/id_ed25519``, ``~/.ssh/id_ecdsa``, ``~/.ssh/id_rsa``). A key "
"protected by a passphrase only works through the agent, since PartCAD never "
"asks for one: a repository it cannot authenticate to fails with an error "
"rather than waiting for a prompt that nothing would answer."
msgstr ""
"通过 SSH 访问的仓库，会先使用正在运行的 SSH agent 所持有的密钥进行认证，然后再使用默认的密钥文件（ "
"``~/.ssh/id_ed25519`` 、 ``~/.ssh/id_ecdsa`` 、 ``~/.ssh/id_rsa`` "
"）。受口令保护的密钥只能通过 agent 使用，因为 PartCAD "
"从不会主动索要口令：对于无法完成认证的仓库，它会直接以错误告终，而不会一直等待一个无人应答的提示。"

